      "rule": "REVIEW",
      "severity": "mandatory",
      "message": "listWidgets filters by Widget.dashboard but uses FD03 (Dashboard Name) as the filter field, which does not identify a dashboard Fix: Remove the input from listWidgets (or use no inputs and resolve dashboard from route context) so the list is not filtered by a name field; FD03 must not be used to filter by ref dashboard (addressed in the final fix, not re-reviewed)",
      "at": "operations.listWidgets.inputs",
      "stage": "contract"
    },
    {
      "rule": "REVIEW",
      "severity": "mandatory",
      "message": "createWidget lists F09.S01 (Duplicate dashboard) but duplicate creates widgets by copying with no type/title/size supplied, so the required inputs type/title/size do not exist at that step Fix: Remove F09.S01 from createWidget.flowSteps; let duplicateDashboard alone serve the Widget create effect of F09.S01 or add a dedicated duplicateWidgets operation with no user inputs (addressed in the final fix, not re-reviewed)",
      "at": "operations.createWidget.flowSteps",
      "stage": "contract"
    },
    {
      "rule": "REVIEW",
      "severity": "mandatory",
      "message": "Input maps FD03 (Dashboard Name) to entity field dashboard; a Name field cannot filter by dashboard ref. Fix: Remove the input or replace it with a dashboard-scoped list with no inputs (dashboard is taken from route context). Do not use FD03 as dashboard. (addressed in the final fix, not re-reviewed)",
      "at": "operations.listWidgets.inputs[0]",
      "stage": "contract"
    },
    {
      "rule": "THEME-001",
      "severity": "mandatory",
      "message": "page dark: pageFgMuted on the background's #004346 is 4.35:1; text needs 4.5:1.",
      "at": "page.dark.pageFgMuted",
      "stage": "design-theme"
    },
    {
      "rule": "REVIEW",
      "severity": "mandatory",
      "message": "Link default is `plain` app-wide, which hides every link and violates the component defaults rule. Fix: Change Link default to not use `plain` (use the default underlined look, e.g. omit `look` or set it to `none`/default) so links remain recognizable. (addressed in the final fix, not re-reviewed)",
      "at": "defaults.Link.look",
      "stage": "design-theme"
    },
    {
      "rule": "REVIEW",
      "severity": "mandatory",
      "message": "Link defaults to `plain` which hides every link app-wide. Fix: Remove the plain look from Link defaults and use the default none look (e.g., omit `look` or set to none) so links are visibly distinct. (addressed in the final fix, not re-reviewed)",
      "at": "defaults.Link.look",
      "stage": "design-theme"
    },
    {
      "rule": "REVIEW",
      "severity": "mandatory",
      "message": "Assumption A17 says no search/filter in MVP but F05 implements Search (FD14) and describes filtering dashboards by name. Fix: Make them consistent: either remove Search FD14 from F05 and keep A17, or update A17 to state home list includes search by name (FD14) to satisfy the editor must-have browse/search expectation and P08. (addressed in the final fix, not re-reviewed)",
      "at": "A17 vs F05",
      "stage": "flows-catalog"
    },
    {
      "rule": "REVIEW",
      "severity": "mandatory",
      "message": "Checklist checked state is a boolean but defined as singleChoice with options checked/unchecked instead of boolean type. Fix: Change FD10 type to boolean (or keep singleChoice but justify) and ensure example and options match the type. (addressed in the final fix, not re-reviewed)",
      "at": "FD10",
      "stage": "flows-catalog"
    },
